---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Poems | Poetry from the North West"
description: "Original poems by Ellie Faye, a North West poet writing from Manchester. New poetry published regularly at Blue Orangutan Tales."
permalink: /poems/
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div><h1>Poems</h1></div>
      <div>
        <p class="lede">Original poetry, written in Manchester and shaped by the North West: its weather, its people and its long tradition of poets who tell it straight.</p>
        <p>New poems will be published here as they are finished. Some will be small and quiet, some will not behave. All of them are mine.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tight">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="post-grid">
      {%- if collections.poems.length %}
      {%- for post in collections.poems %}
      {% include "post-card.njk" %}
      {%- endfor %}
      {%- else %}
      <div class="post-card coming-soon">
        <p class="post-meta"><span class="post-tag">Poem</span> &middot; Coming soon</p>
        <h3>The first poems are on their way</h3>
        <p>A handful of poems are being polished for the page right now. In the meantime, works in progress and shorter pieces appear on Instagram first.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-blue" href="{{ site.instagram }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Follow on Instagram</a>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "url": "{{ page.url | absoluteUrl(site.url) }}",
  "name": "Poems at {{ site.name }}",
  "description": "Original poems by a North West poet writing from Manchester",
  "isPartOf": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#website" },
  "author": { "@id": "{{ site.url }}/#ellie" },
  "inLanguage": "en-GB"
}
</script>
